*2026-08-03 22:13:27*

**Foreign decisions got a namespace, and the first version of it bent the tool around one repository — which took a decision, a supersession, and about four hours to notice.** The idea is small: `LU-ADR-013` composes a registered remote prefix with that project's own code, one config entry builds the URL, and from there it is a first-class reference — the fixer writes the link, the lint demands it. That part was right in [ADR-015](../../record/decisions.d/ADR-015.md) and is unchanged in [ADR-016](../../record/decisions.d/ADR-016.md).

